Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 10:13:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] Settings: no donation links

The "Support Me" button in Settings' footer and the dialog it opened
(QR codes, Ko-fi, Afdian, Patreon, WeChat, PayPal and crypto addresses)
are gone from this build. The script that drives them finds nothing to
bind to and does nothing; Discord and A2Tools.app stay in the footer.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RBQati3x8VviBbpY9juEWf
